{"id":"wb-5-172","name":"恭陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"恭陵","text":"恭陵位于缑氏县（今中国河南省洛阳市偃师区缑氏镇）东北2.5公里的滹沱岭上。为唐高宗第五子、武则天长子李弘墓。陵园座北朝南，平面正方形，建筑规化工整，长、宽均440米。四面建围墙，辟四门，门外均有石狮一对。神道宽50米，两旁列石雕佣群，封土呈覆斗状。东西现长150米，南北宽130米，现高22米。其东北50米为太子妃裴氏墓，底边长、宽40-50米，现高13米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%81%AD%E9%99%B5","revisionId":87803109,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87803109","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9666523edd41c565770234e6.jpg","title":"20231119_Gongling_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20231119_Gongling_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/20231119_Gongling_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Gongling, the tomb of Prince Li Hong, son of Wu Zetian.","width":320,"height":214}}